    description: "PlazaFlow three-layer encryption (content/navigation/attribution DEKs from fragment key via HKDF-SHA-256, AES-256-GCM) is architecturally central. Agents debugging 'why can't a visitor read navigation data?' need to trace key derivation chains. Gap: no pattern set for WebCrypto API (crypto.subtle.deriveKey/encrypt/decrypt) or Rust equivalents (hkdf::Hkdf, aes_gcm::Aes256Gcm). Needs YAML-driven dataflow patterns producing derives_from/encrypts_with edges. Builds on ADR-0015 dataflow infrastructure. Bakeoff repos: arti (Tor client, heavy crypto), signal-related repos if available. Cross-refs: ADR-0015 dataflow YAMLs (WI-zobid done), existing dataflow_patterns/ directory."  # 645e
